@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title VGO ATS 本机开发与可选独立部署
left to right direction

node "本机开发环境" as Local {
  node "React / Vite\nlocalhost:5173" as Web
  node "Java 模块化单体\nlocalhost:8080" as App
  database "独立 MySQL\nvgo_hr" as DB
  database "独立 Elasticsearch" as ES
  folder "LOCAL 文件存储\n.runtime/objects" as Files
  Web --> App : 同源代理 /api
  App --> DB
  App --> ES
  App --> Files
}

cloud "可选模型、邮件和协同平台\n默认关闭，显式配置后启用" as External
App ..> External : 经窄 API / Port

node "使用者自行配置的部署环境" as Deployment {
  node "HTTPS / Nginx\nReact 静态制品" as Edge
  node "同一 bootstrap 制品" as Server
  database "自己的业务库与搜索" as Services
  folder "自己的持久文件存储" as Storage
  Edge --> Server : 同源 /api 与 SSE
  Server --> Services
  Server --> Storage
}

note bottom of Local
端口只绑定本机，独立命名卷与示例凭据；
真实外部测试必须确认隔离，不操作共享业务数据。
end note

note bottom of Deployment
使用自己的域名、证书、Secret、备份和健康扫描器；
部署模板不带公司服务器身份或运行参数。
end note
@enduml
